repository-code: "https://github.com/aldofebrian-af/digimasi-research"
url: "https://digimasi.com/en/research/"
abstract: >-
  Weekly summaries from a passive sensor on digimasi.com, a static company website in Indonesia: what automated
  programs look for (secret configuration files, code history folders, WordPress, cloud keys, login pages) on a site
  that has none of them. Totals, categories, most requested paths, source networks and countries, and stock usernames
  guessed. No IP addresses, passwords or raw records are published.
